<title>UK: Newman Tonks says FKI has 13.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Newman Tonks says FKI has 13.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Building equipment firm Newman Tonks Group said on Wednesday that engineering company FKI Plc had an interest in 17.12 million shares representing 13.3 percent in the issues share capital of the company.</p>
<p>FKI launched a 195.7 million stg hostile bid for Newman Tonks in December, an offer which Newman Tonks has urged its shareholders to reject.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
